 es. For digital showtimes\, visit the other The Odyssey page.***NOTE: We
  will not be playing trailers before the 70mm screenings. Please arrive on
  time.***  **The Balcony is not accessible by elevator.**\n\nhttps://www.
 siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/the-odyssey-(70mm)\n\nEstimated start: 19:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
